#: index.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Isaac Lab** is a unified and modular framework for robot learning that "
"aims to simplify common workflows in robotics research (such as "
"reinforcement learning, learning from demonstrations, and motion planning). "
"It supports `NVIDIA Isaac Sim`_ for photo-realistic scenes and RTX "
"rendering, and can also run standalone with the Newton physics backend for "
"fast and efficient simulation without requiring a full Isaac Sim "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"**Isaac Lab** 是一个统一、模块化的机器人学习框架，旨在简化机器人研究中的常见工作流程，包括强化学习、模仿学习和运动规划。它支持使用 "
"`NVIDIA Isaac Sim`_ 构建逼真的场景并进行 RTX 渲染，也可以独立使用 Newton 物理后端，在不安装完整 Isaac Sim "
"的情况下实现高效仿真。"

#: index.rst:16
msgid "The core objectives of the framework are:"
msgstr "该框架的核心目标包括: "

#: index.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Modularity**: Easily customize and add new environments, robots, and "
"sensors."
msgstr "**模块化**: 轻松定制并添加新的环境、机器人和传感器。"

#: index.rst:19
msgid "**Agility**: Adapt to the changing needs of the community."
msgstr "**灵活性**: 适应社区的不断变化需求。"

#: index.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Openness**: Remain open-sourced to allow the community to contribute and "
"extend the framework."
msgstr "**开放性**: 保持开源，允许社区贡献和扩展该框架。"

#: index.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Batteries-included**: Include a number of environments, sensors, and tasks"
" that are ready to use."
msgstr "**功能齐全**: 包括多种环境、传感器和任务，可供直接使用。"

#: index.rst:23
msgid ""
"Key features available in Isaac Lab include fast and accurate physics "
"simulation powered by both the **PhysX** and **Newton** backends, tiled "
"rendering APIs for vectorized rendering with support for both **RTX** and "
"**Newton** camera sensors, domain randomization for improving robustness and"
" adaptability, and support for running in the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 的主要功能包括：由 **PhysX** 和 **Newton** 后端提供的快速、准确的物理仿真；用于向量化渲染的平铺渲染 "
"API，支持 **RTX** 和 **Newton** 相机传感器；用于提高鲁棒性和适应性的域随机化；以及云端运行支持。"

#: index.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Upgrading from Isaac Lab 2.x?** See the :ref:`migrating-to-isaaclab-3-0` "
"guide for a full list of breaking changes and the new multi-backend "
"architecture introduced in Isaac Lab 3.0."
msgstr ""
"**从 Isaac Lab 2.x 升级？** 请参阅 :ref:`migrating-to-isaaclab-3-0` ，了解全部不兼容变更，以及 "
"Isaac Lab 3.0 引入的多后端架构。"

#: index.rst:33
msgid ""
"Additionally, Isaac Lab provides a variety of environments, and we are "
"actively working on adding more environments to the list. These include "
"classic control tasks, fixed-arm and dexterous manipulation tasks, legged "
"locomotion tasks, and navigation tasks. Browse the registered tasks and "
"build a command in the :doc:`environment browser "
"<source/setup/environments>`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 提供了多种环境，并持续增加新的环境，涵盖经典控制、固定机械臂操作、灵巧操作、足式运动和导航任务。你可以在 :doc:`环境浏览器 "
"<source/setup/environments>` 中查看已注册的任务，并生成运行命令。"

#: index.rst:38
msgid ""
"Isaac lab is developed with specific robot assets that are now **Batteries-"
"included** as part of the platform and are ready to learn! These robots "
"include..."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 内置多种机器人资产， **开箱即用** ，可直接用于学习任务。包括以下机器人："

#: index.rst:40
msgid "**Classic** Cartpole, Humanoid, Ant"
msgstr "**经典** Cartpole, Humanoid, Ant"

#: index.rst:41
msgid "**Fixed-Arm and Hands**: UR10, Franka, Allegro, Shadow Hand"
msgstr "**固定机械臂和机械手**: UR10, Franka, Allegro, Shadow Hand"

#: index.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Quadrupeds**: Anybotics AnymalB, AnymalC, AnymalD, Unitree A1, Unitree "
"Go1, Unitree Go2, Boston Dynamics Spot"
msgstr ""
"**四足机器人** ：Anybotics AnymalB、AnymalC、AnymalD、Unitree A1、Unitree Go1、Unitree "
"Go2、Boston Dynamics Spot"

#: index.rst:43
msgid "**Humanoids**: Unitree H1, Unitree G1"
msgstr "**人型机器人**: Unitree H1, Unitree G1"

#: index.rst:44
msgid "**Quadcopter**: Crazyflie"
msgstr "**四轴飞行器**: Crazyflie"

#: index.rst:46
msgid ""
"The platform is also designed so that you can add your own robots! Please "
"refer to the :ref:`how-to` section for details."
msgstr "平台还设计了可以让您添加自己的机器人！具体操作方法请参阅 :ref:`how-to` 部分。"

#: index.rst:49
msgid ""
"For more information about the framework, please refer to the `technical "
"report <https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.04831>`_ :cite:`mittal2025isaaclab`. For "
"clarifications on NVIDIA Isaac ecosystem, please check out the :ref:`isaac-"
"lab-ecosystem` section."
msgstr ""
"有关该框架的更多信息，请参阅 `技术报告 <https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.04831>`_ "
":cite:`mittal2025isaaclab` 。有关 NVIDIA Isaac 生态系统的阐述，请查看 :ref:`isaac-lab-"
"ecosystem` 部分。"

